    "title": "Turner Wins Agriculture History Museum Fair Contest - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WGEL ,\n10 hours ago The Bond County Agriculture History Museum has announced the winner of its “Guess How Many Popcorn Kernels” contest held during the recent Bond County Fair. Micah Turner of Greenville submitted a guess of 1,742 kernels, coming closest to the actual total of 1,824 kernels in the milk bottle. Read full article",
